factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  slides_spec.hl1 says 'மோகனூரில் சேவல் சண்டை: 3 பேர் கைது' and the draft's tamil_headline says 'மூவரும்'-style claims are fine, but slides_spec 'எங்கே?' slide says the cockfight took place in 'மோகனூர் டவுன் பஞ்சாயத்து, மணியங்காளிப்பட்டி' — accurate; however the 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says 'சிலர் தப்பி ஓடினர்' while the article says those involved fled and went into hiding (தலைமறைவாகினர்), which the caption renders as 'தப்பி ஓடி தலைமறைவாயினர' — no issue there.
  slides_spec 'கைது' slide states 'மூவரும் கரூர் மாவட்டத்தைச் சேர்ந்தவர்கள்' but the article says Bharathi is from Athur in Karur district and the other two from Karur — this is consistent, so not a problem; however the slide's 'போலீசார் விசாரணை தொடர்கிறது' (investigation continues) is an invented detail not stated in the article.
  The reel_script states the police 'முறியடித்து' (foiled) the cockfight, a characterization not in the article, which only says they conducted a search and arrested people.
  The reel_script's 'ரூ.300 பணத்தையும்' and the phrase 'சேவல்களையும்' are fine, but the reel_script says the arrested were 'வாலிபர்கள' in the headline; the article does not specify their age group beyond ages 23–28, so calling them 'வாலிபர்கள' is acceptable wording rather than a factual error.
  The reel_script omits that the people who fled went into hiding (தலைமறைவாகினர்) and that the 3 arrested were caught after being surrounded — the surround detail is present, but the important fact that the cockfight participants fled and hid is only partially conveyed.
